{
  "title": "Pyramids",
  "about": "The three pyramids of Giza in soft clay under a big sun, for the Dinki Dell doof. The sun's fat rays turn behind them, the dunes roll and the Nile runs along the front as the cover's blue tube. On the beat a light climbs each pyramid's edges in turn (left, middle, right) and the stone courses glint; the capstone, the eye in a golden triangle, floats over the great pyramid, comes down through a build and lands on the drop, sending a beam of light into the sky.",
